# Raw event photo/video dumps (not needed for website)
# Anchored to repo root (leading /) so these never accidentally match a
# nested folder/file of the same name elsewhere in the tree — e.g. the bare
# "Spy" pattern used to also match img/packages/spy/ on case-insensitive
# filesystems, silently keeping the entire spy package image folder out of
# git (fixed 2026-08-08; see "From real Spy Missions" broken-image report).
