# Raw gallery video dumps (2026-08-15, per Shruti — "compress the videos and
# upload"). gallery.html only links to the compressed copies in
# img/Gallery/Testimonials/web/ (~66MB total); these are the original
# uncompressed phone recordings (~460MB+ combined) sitting alongside them —
# no reason to also commit those to git. If you add more raw video to any
# img/Gallery/<Category>/ folder, it's excluded by default too; drop a
# compressed copy in a web/ subfolder and reference that instead.
img/Gallery/**/*.mp4
img/Gallery/**/*.MOV
!img/Gallery/**/web/*.mp4

# Accidental "Save As" export of a Google Photos page (not real gallery
# content) that ended up inside img/Gallery/Spy/ (2026-08-15).
img/Gallery/Spy/Photo in Neha Adiva Sherlock*

# Scratch preview folders used while sanity-checking the site-wide logo
# watermark pass (2026-08-16) — not real site content.
_to_delete_watermark_previews/
_watermark_preview/
_watermark_preview_orig/
_watermark_preview2/

# Raw/original source videos (uncompressed camera/phone uploads) kept as
# input material for the compression pipeline — the actual compressed
# copies used by the site live in the clean-named folders (img/MagicShow/,
# img/Chitrakathi/, etc.). These raw files are large (50MB-200MB+) and
# blow past GitHub's file-size limits, so keep them out of git entirely.
img/Magic Show/*.mp4
img/Chitrakathi Shadow Puppet Show/*.mp4
img/activity/**/*.mp4

# General scratch folder used during editing sessions (stale git lock
# backups, old preview crops, etc.) — never real site content.
_to_delete/

# Business/vendor spreadsheets (ERP exports, supplier master data, etc.) —
# this is a public repo (GitHub Pages), so these should never be committed.
# Wondershop_PreLaunch_QA_Test_Plan.xlsx predates this rule and stays
# tracked as-is; this only stops NEW xlsx files from being added by
# accident (e.g. a broad `git add .`). (2026-09-13, per Shruti)
*.xlsx

# Stray Node.js installer that ended up in the repo root — unrelated to
# the site, shouldn't be versioned. (2026-09-13)
node-v24.20.0.pkg

